{"data": [{"author_id": "1769051162169561089", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:44:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117010003467104570"], "id": "2117010003467104570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "脑机接口今年最值得关注的不是「读脑」，而是「写脑」：让信号反向注入大脑，帮助失明者重建视觉、让瘫痪者重获运动能力。当技术从实验室走进医院，伦理讨论才真正开始。", "url": "https://x.com/hajiMVP/status/2117010003467104570"}, {"author_id": "716440361871106049", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:25:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117005113281949911"], "id": "2117005113281949911", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1284, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "I can't go another day without a revival of Silicon Valley for the AI&lt;&gt;BCI and AI&lt;&gt;bio era. \n\nWe need a pressure release valve for all of the larping and bold, not even forward-looking and probably, sometimes, totally inaccurate claims about what is possible today versus what may", "url": "https://x.com/samalanascience/status/2117005113281949911"}, {"author_id": "227707405", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:10:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117001295089553909"], "id": "2117001295089553909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 111, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Elon literally started Neuralink to solve the AI alignment threat via high-bandwidth human-AI symbiosis. So why pivot resources into xAI to compete in software frontier models? If consumer BCI is our ultimate defensive play against Rogue AI, shouldn't that be ground zero?", "url": "https://x.com/srinikatta/status/2117001295089553909"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1769051162169561089", "name": "方不休", "username": "hajiMVP"}, {"id": "716440361871106049", "name": "sam (tabone) rector", "username": "samalanascience"}, {"id": "227707405", "name": "Srini Katta", "username": "srinikatta"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117010003467104570", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyi51rk85zoboj7eh3cxxkhya2l", "oldest_id": "2117001295089553909", "result_count": 3}}
